      "id": "recurrence",
      "title": "Choose recurrence and repeat behavior",
      "optional": true,
      "instructions": "Choose manual-only or a reviewed schedule, trigger, function, or Automation. Manual-only completes this decision. Compare later runs to the recorded baseline rule; note instrumentation or traffic changes and close the regression only after a comparable retest. Test a configured route before activation."
